he closest posterior margin  the axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes  which range in size from removed_date x 3 x 1 9cm to 0 2cm in greatest dimension  representative sections are submitted as follows  section code a b  biopsy cavity  1  with closest posterior margin in a  c d  biopsy cavity  2  e  small papillary mass  f  fibrocystic change from lower inner quadrant  g  fibrocystic change and posterior margin from lower outer quadrant  h  fibrocystic area from upper inner quadrant  i  fibrocystic change from upper outer quadrant  j  axillary lymph node  bisected and entirely submitted  k p  axillary lymph nodes  entirely submitted  q r  representative sections of largest lymph node  s z  biopsy cavities  aa bb  remainder of largest lymph node  cc    axillary lymph node  dd hh  parenchyma jj kk  biopsy cavity ll  parenchyma resident  paula arnell  md                                                                                 source care unit  mgh inpatient  flr unknown  reports to  kevin hughes md jonathan michael winograd  m d  part   breast  right   modified radical mastectomy , Present.
